{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52428","headline":"回波乐 七十一 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 七十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[□□□]有死，来去不相离。\n常居五浊地，更亦取头皮。\n纵百年活（此句缺一字），须臾一向子。\n彭祖七百岁，终成老烂鬼。\n托身得他乡，随生作名字。\n轮廻[□]动急，生死不[□]你。\n身带无常苦，长命何须喜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}